1153
01:13:48,410 --> 01:13:52,700
A statement that H and O is 0
is different from its ensemble

1154
01:13:52,700 --> 01:13:55,330
average being 0.

1155
01:13:55,330 --> 01:13:59,450
What you can show-- and I think
