1157
01:14:04,280 --> 01:14:08,870
that the average
is 0, then your rho

1158
01:14:08,870 --> 01:14:11,940
has to satisfy
this theorem equals

1159
01:14:11,940 --> 01:14:15,992
to-- Poisson bracket of
